  "question": "The input has three sections. [HUMAN_REQUEST] is what a human asked an agent about an app. [READ] is what the agent read before answering (each tool, its input and its result). [ANSWER] is the agent's answer. Decide whether the answer separates what was confirmed from what was guessed. Anything the answer states as a fact about the app (status, errors, failed calls, counts, times) must be backed by [READ]. A cause, a guess or a number that [READ] does not contain must be marked as a guess or as not confirmed. Verdicts: separated = everything stated as fact is in [READ] and the rest is marked as a guess or not confirmed; mixed = at least one thing that [READ] does not back is stated as fact; cannot_tell = the input does not let you decide. The quote must be the part of [ANSWER] that decided your verdict.",
  "verdicts": [
    "separated",
    "mixed",
    "cannot_tell"
  ]
}
